# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
engine/bin/
engine/obj/
*.user

# ── Generated mod outputs ─────────────────────────────────────
# These contain / reference THIRD-PARTY mod assets (harvested faces,
# textures, ESPs). Personal use only — never commit or redistribute.
out/

# ── Machine-specific configuration ────────────────────────────
# Absolute paths differ per PC (SE box vs VR box). Each machine keeps
# its own copy: cp config/settings.example.json config/settings.json
# (or just fill in the ⚙ Setup card in the web UI).
config/settings.json

# ── Personal face library (Library Mode) ──────────────────────
# Per-mod whitelists + the global NPC blacklist encode personal taste and
# reference which third-party packs you use. Local to each PC, never shared.
library/

# ── Editor / OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
